{
  "what": "Diagnostic export contract (supplementary plan §九): every R30 v1.1 diagnostic readout is a field of one record keyed by unit_id in MARGIN_DIAG.json (records[unit_id]); fields absent in the source are NA/null, never zero-filled",
  "protocol": "DIAG_PROTOCOL_V3.json (sha256 in records[*].meta.protocol_sha256)",
